# Only reader-facing overview files belong under tracked docs/.
# Detailed research, implementation, Superpowers, archives and evidence stay local.
/docs/*
!/docs/architecture/
/docs/architecture/*
!/docs/architecture/README.md
!/docs/architecture/STRUCTURE.md
!/docs/api/
/docs/api/*
!/docs/api/README.md
!/docs/security/
/docs/security/*
!/docs/security/README.md
!/docs/decisions/
