!/docs/decisions/README.md

# Standalone prototypes and supplied local source documents
/*.html
/*.pdf
/prototypes/
**/prototypes/
/tests/prototype-*
/context.md

# Local coding-agent skill packs and generated editor instructions.
# Keep the hand-maintained root AGENTS.md tracked.
/.agents/
/.codex/
/skills-lock.json
/frontend/AGENTS.md

# OS and package-manager logs
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
